ing_power","r":"management","s":"August Troendle","x":"Although overall net awards were sequentially higher in Q1 at $249 million, the level of net direct revenue or service revenue based awards were down in the quarter, reflecting a higher proportion of pass-through amounts.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/04/30/medpace-holdings-inc-medp-q1-2019-earnings-call-tr.aspx"},{"c":"MEDP 2019 Q1","e":"medp","d":"2019-04-30","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"August Troendle","x":"But, yeah, the other thing is that we've had a increased level of pass-through component of our mix in awards.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/04/30/medpace-holdings-inc-medp-q1-2019-earnings-call-tr.aspx"},{"c":"MEDP 2019 Q2","e":"medp","d":"2019-07-30","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"August Troendle","x":"Book -- and those pass-through characteristics are a bit later in projects and the book-to-bill will virtually always be substantially higher under 606 basis and 605 basis points.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/07/30/medpace-holdings-inc-medp-q2-2019-earnings-call-tr.aspx"},{"c":"MEDP 2019 Q2","e":"medp","d":"2019-07-30","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Jesse Geiger","x":"The Q2 level in margin level was impacted by a relatively flat pass-through cost compared to the revenue increase.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/07/30/medpace-holdings-inc-medp-q2-2019-earnings-call-tr.aspx"},{"c":"MEDP 2019 Q4","e":"medp","d":"2020-02-25","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"August Troendle","x":"I would like to point out that our reported EBITDA is not inflated by adding back recurring and real operating costs such as stock-based compensation, program costs to improve operating efficiency, restructuring costs, severance payments or integration costs.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/02/25/medpace-holdings-inc-medp-q4-2019-earnings-call-tr.aspx"},{"c":"MEDP 2020 Q1","e":"medp","d":"2020-04-29","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"August Troendle","x":"Pass-through costs, the bulk of which represent independent investigative state payments and monitoring travel, are also disproportionately impacted.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/04/29/medpace-holdings-inc-medp-q1-2020-earnings-call-tr.aspx"},{"c":"MEDP 2020 Q1","e":"medp","d":"2020-04-29","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"August Troendle","x":"So our pass-through investigator payments are hit more than our services, which are more FTE.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/04/29/medpace-holdings-inc-medp-q1-2020-earnings-call-tr.aspx"},{"c":"MEDP 2020 Q2","e":"medp","d":"2020-07-28","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"August Troendle","x":"I'm sorry, pass-through should accelerate in the second half also.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/07/28/medpace-holdings-inc-common-stock-medp-q2-2020-ear.aspx"},{"c":"MEDP 2020 Q2","e":"medp","d":"2020-07-28","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"August Troendle","x":"So that should be a little bit of a drag on margin itself, but push on revenue, getting us back up because pass-through should come back to some extent, but still meaningfully below prior years and first quarter.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/07/28/medpace-holdings-inc-common-stock-medp-q2-2020-ear.aspx"},{"c":"MEDP 2020 Q2","e":"medp","d":"2020-07-28","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Jesse Geiger","x":"The decrease was primarily attributable to higher employee-related costs including severance partially offset by lower reimbursed out-of-pocket expenses on lower revenue.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/07/28/medpace-holdings-inc-common-stock-medp-q2-2020-ear.aspx"},{"c":"MEDP 2020 Q2","e":"medp","d":"2020-07-28","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Jesse Geiger","x":"Net income decline was 