ldwell","x":"Is it a scenario where you could actually have margin stability or expansion because your cost reduction and your hiring demands would come in so much?","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2022/07/26/medpace-holdings-inc-common-stock-medp-q2-2022-ear/"},{"c":"MEDP 2025 Q2","e":"medp","d":"2025-07-22","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"August James Troendle","x":"And I think that we could have growth rates similar to this year ex the pass-through stuff, right?","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/04/22/medpace-medp-q2-2025-earnings-transcript/"},{"c":"MEDP 2025 Q2","e":"medp","d":"2025-07-22","l":"pricing_power","r":"analyst","s":"David Howard Windley","x":"I was hoping you could maybe walk me to water a little bit on how much of the increased guide is pass-through versus direct revenue?","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/04/22/medpace-medp-q2-2025-earnings-transcript/"},{"c":"MEDP 2025 Q2","e":"medp","d":"2025-07-22","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Kevin M. Brady","x":"This increased guidance assumes a full year 2025 effective tax rate of 18.5% to 19%, interest income of $11.6 million and 29.4 million diluted weighted average shares outstanding for 2025.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/04/22/medpace-medp-q2-2025-earnings-transcript/"},{"c":"MEDP 2025 Q3","e":"medp","d":"2025-10-23","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"August Troendle","x":"We believe pass-through costs will remain high compared to historical levels and represent between 41% and 42% of revenue.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2025/11/27/medpace-medp-q3-2025-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"MEDP 2025 Q3","e":"medp","d":"2025-10-23","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"August Troendle","x":"But timing of projects and having a lot of late-stage projects in what we're burning as we're going to start ramping up new studies, new studies are -- even if they have the same mix of pass-through costs, there's greater direct costs incurred earlier in a trial.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2025/11/27/medpace-medp-q3-2025-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"MEDP 2025 Q4","e":"medp","d":"2026-02-10","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"August Troendle","x":"These were known to be very high pass-through projects, you know, going in.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/02/10/medpace-medp-q4-2025-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"MEDP 2025 Q4","e":"medp","d":"2026-02-10","l":"pricing_power","r":"analyst","s":"David Windley","x":"To what extent is that underlying, like, site-level inflation and things like that you're having to rebudget and add, and therefore, those adjustments are kind of going directly into backlog and right into revenue and kind of the pass-through outstripping is what's driving this higher burn rate.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/02/10/medpace-medp-q4-2025-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"MEDP 2025 Q4","e":"medp","d":"2026-02-10","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Kevin Brady","x":"So it's not that I would say that we've got major cost savings initiatives that are out there or certainly not planning on restructuring.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/02/10/medpace-medp-q4-2025-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"MEDP 2026 Q1","e":"medp","d":"2026-04-23","l":"ai_spend","r":"analyst","s":"Jailendra P. Singh","x":"Last quarter you mentioned that in 2026 you do not expect a net productivity benefit from AI as investments would offset gains.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/04/23/medpace-medp-q1-2026-earnings-transcript/"},{"c":"MEDP 2026 Q1","e":"medp","d":"2026-04-23","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"August James Troendle","x":"We have not been great at predicting when pass-through investigator costs will hit, and they have been a larger portion lately.","url":"https:/